1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,280
Every single night, the lonely young boy desperately wished he could stop time.

2
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:11,112
Then one miraculous day, his heartfelt wish finally came true across the quiet room.

3
00:00:11,112 --> 00:00:17,231
He could completely freeze everything surrounding him, including the falling rain and rushing wind.

4
00:00:17,231 --> 00:00:22,896
At first, wielding this incredible cosmic power made him feel like an almighty god.

5
00:00:22,896 --> 00:00:28,968
He easily used his amazing ability to completely avoid all pain and difficult problems.

6
00:00:28,968 --> 00:00:35,807
However, after many peaceful days, he slowly noticed something truly terrifying happening around him.

7
00:00:35,807 --> 00:00:42,192
Every single time time stopped, someone he deeply loved lost another precious memory forever.

8
00:00:42,192 --> 00:00:48,264
Completely desperate now, he halted the entire world one last time to whisper his truth.

9
00:00:48,264 --> 00:00:54,336
He finally let time flow forward again, embracing the unpredictable rhythm of living life.

10
00:00:54,336 --> 00:01:00,384
Instead of living forever, he bravely chose to grow older alongside the people he loved.
